1512	     * The status on the given day once the given amount has been paid against the grand total at the
1513	     * tax rate: a sent invoice with something still due more than {@link #graceDays()} days after its
1514	     * due date is overdue, part paid or not. Held retention is never due, so never makes it overdue;
1515	     * released retention is due {@link #RETENTION_DUE_DAYS} days after its release, and payments go to
1516	     * the rest of the invoice before it. An invoice spread over instalments is instead overdue when any
1517	     * of its instalments is (see {@link #instalmentProgress}).
